<h2 id="component-reference" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#component-reference">#</a> Component Reference</h2>
<h3 id="alert-box" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#alert-box">#</a> Alert Box</h3>
<pre class="shiki github-light line-numbers"><code><span class="line" data-line="1"><span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">&#x3C;</span><span style="color:#22863A">alert-box</span><span style="color:#6F42C1"> kind</span><span style="color:#24292E">=</span><span style="color:#032F62">"note|tip|warning|danger|info|caution"</span><span style="color:#6F42C1"> dismissible</span><span style="color:#24292E">></span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">  Your message here with **markdown** support</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="3"><span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">&#x3C;/</span><span style="color:#22863A">alert-box</span><span style="color:#24292E">></span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="4"><span class="line"></span></span></code></pre>
<p><strong>Attributes:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><code>type</code> - Alert type: <code>note</code>, <code>tip</code>, <code>warning</code>, <code>danger</code>, <code>info</code>, <code>caution</code> (default: <code>note</code>)</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="button-primary" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#button-primary">#</a> Button Primary</h3>
<pre class="shiki github-light line-numbers"><code><span class="line" data-line="1"><span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">&#x3C;</span><span style="color:#22863A">button-primary</span><span style="color:#6F42C1"> href</span><span style="color:#24292E">=</span><span style="color:#032F62">"/link"</span><span style="color:#6F42C1"> icon</span><span style="color:#24292E">=</span><span style="color:#032F62">"emoji"</span><span style="color:#6F42C1"> arrow</span><span style="color:#6F42C1"> disabled</span><span style="color:#24292E">></span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">  Button Text</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="3"><span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">&#x3C;/</span><span style="color:#22863A">button-primary</span><span style="color:#24292E">></span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="4"><span class="line"></span></span></code></pre>
<p><strong>Attributes:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><code>href</code> - Link URL (default: <code>#</code>)</li>
<li><code>icon</code> - Emoji or icon text (optional)</li>
<li><code>arrow</code> - Show arrow (optional)</li>
<li><code>disabled</code> - Disable button (optional)</li>
</ul>
