<h3 id="icon" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#icon">#</a> Icon</h3>
<pre class="shiki github-light line-numbers"><code><span class="line" data-line="1"><span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">&#x3C;</span><span style="color:#22863A">icon</span><span style="color:#6F42C1"> name</span><span style="color:#24292E">=</span><span style="color:#032F62">"icon-name"</span><span style="color:#6F42C1"> size</span><span style="color:#24292E">=</span><span style="color:#032F62">"24"</span><span style="color:#6F42C1"> color</span><span style="color:#24292E">=</span><span style="color:#032F62">"primary"</span><span style="color:#6F42C1"> spin</span><span style="color:#24292E"> /></span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span class="line"></span></span></code></pre>
<p><strong>Attributes:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><code>name</code> - Icon name (required)</li>
<li><code>size</code> - Size in pixels (default: <code>20</code>)</li>
<li><code>color</code> - Color: <code>primary|success|warning|danger|light</code> (default: current color)</li>
<li><code>spin</code> - Add spinning animation (optional)</li>
<li><code>strokeWidth</code> - Stroke width (default: <code>2</code>)</li>
<li><code>fill</code> - Fill color (default: <code>none</code>)</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<p><strong>Pro Tip:</strong> All components support dark mode and are fully responsive! 🌙</p>

